# Weekly Discovery Pattern Analysis — environment variables
#
# By default this agent uses OAuth-connected accounts (call recorder, CRM, chat tool) and needs NO keys
# here. Only fill these in if a connected service requires an API key that isn't handled by its OAuth
# connection.

# Example (uncomment and set if needed):
# CALL_RECORDER_API_KEY=your-call-recorder-api-key
# CRM_API_KEY=your-crm-api-key
